1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,400
We built Road Desk: AI agents
do the legwork,

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:06,000
people make the calls.

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:09,600
On our estimates, a car issue takes
under ten minutes of an operator's time,

4
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,200
not half an hour.

5
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:14,000
The AI costs about twelve cents.

6
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,500
Quiet morning.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,500
Keys. Agent's got it.

8
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,000
No no no no. What is that light?
It's shaking!

9
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,500
Okay, okay.

10
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,000
...Okay. Somebody's got this.

11
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,500
Right. That one's mine.

12
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Not now.

13
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Hamburg.

14
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:23,500
The map shows every car,

15
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:27,000
and only the ones that need
a person glow red.

16
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:45,000
We built it with coding agents
working in parallel,

17
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:48,000
and we didn't take their first answer.

18
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:53,500
The strongest model was too slow for
a phone call, so we split the voice in two.

19
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:58,000
At night, models played drivers
and customers against the real app

20
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:01,000
and found sixteen faults.

21
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:05,500
A second model reviewed it from Bahn's side,

22
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:10,000
and now the stop instruction goes out
before the model is even asked.

23
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:14,500
It's a prototype. The phones, GPS and ferries
are simulated, there's no login yet,

24
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:20,500
and the savings are our estimates,
not Bahn's numbers.

25
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:24,500
Next is a shadow pilot on one lane,
with the agent drafting

26
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:28,000
and people still doing everything.

27
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:32,000
Then login, alerts, an EU-hosted model,

28
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:36,000
and more freedom for the agent,
one action at a time, as it earns it.

29
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:39,500
We would love to show you
Road Desk running.

30
00:02:39,500 --> 00:02:43,800
Find us at [booth], or watch the repo.
